> Current work branch: `feat/cpu-vulkan-hybrid-inference`
> Merged PR #18: [Fix file import routing and add persistent File Library](https://github.com/SamYoBoi284/Sync-AI/pull/18). Current inference work is on `feat/cpu-vulkan-hybrid-inference`.
> Stable release baseline: `v0.3.0`, branch `fix/generation-timer-alarm-export`
